@participant17 

> We're having trouble consistently repro'ing this, so any additional information is appreciated

I've just found out that v30.0.4 crashes on Linux on just pure https://github.com/electron/electron-quick-start repo when you just maximize and then de-maximize the window. Make sure it runs v30.0.4 as it doesn't crash on v30.0.0 `when you just maximize and then de-maximize the window`. Dump attached (same as taken from the actual app, ie `SetBoundsRect` stuff in the stack trace): [electron-v30.0.4-linux-x64-symbols-dump-10.txt](https://github.com/electron/electron/files/15312218/electron-v30.0.4-linux-x64-symbols-dump-10.txt).
